SUMMARY:Sound Healing Meditation with Himalayan Bowls
DESCRIPTION:Inner Peace Collective\nWelcome to the Sound Healing Meditatio
 n with Himalayan Bowls\n[Every Weekend @ 11am\, 3pm & 6pm](https://somatic
 sounds.net/events/)\n\\* $26 to reserve please use the event link [https:/
 /somaticsounds.net/events/](https://somaticsounds.net/events/)\n\nCome imm
 erse yourself in a somatic journey of sound and relaxation\, \, where anci
 ent wisdom meets modern well-being. Imagine the soothing tones of Himalaya
 n singing bowls washing over you\, calming your mind\, and rejuvenating yo
 ur spirit.\n\nFacilitated by Vivek\, this sound journey features over 40 h
 andcrafted singing bowls\, each emitting a rich spectrum of intricate\, hi
 ghly somatic frequencies and overtones—offering more than just a sound b
 ath. The harmonious and grounding sounds have the potential to deeply infl
 uence your physical\, emotional\, mental\, and spiritual states of being.\
 nThis event is open to all levels—whether you’re a seasoned mindfulnes
 s enthusiast\, exploring a novel path to relaxation\, or simply seeking st
 ress relief.\n\nWhat to expect:\nThis somatic experience led by sound bath
  facilitator Vivek\, will be centered around the body’s Chakra energy po
 ints. Be prepared to experience a gentle transformation\, feeling a harmon
 ious balance and alignment enveloping you.\n\n\\*\\* $26 to Reserve a spot
  please use Event Link or Contact Vivek\n**[Every Weekend @ 11am\, 3pm & 6
 pm](https://somaticsounds.net/events/)**\nOr\n**[Contact Vivek](https://so
 maticsounds.net/contact/)**\n\n#soundhealing #soundbath #meditation
