SUMMARY:Sunday Sound Meditation with Himalayan Bowls
DESCRIPTION:Inner Peace Collective\n**Start Your Work Week with a Sound Me
 ditation:**\n[Every Weekend @ 11am\, 3pm & 6pm](https://somaticsounds.net/
 events/)\n**\\* $26 to reserve please use the event link** [https://somati
 csounds.net/events/](https://somaticsounds.net/events/)\n\nStep into a som
 atic journey of sound and relaxation\, where ancient wisdom meets modern w
 ell-being. Let the soothing tones of Himalayan singing bowls wash over you
 \, calming your mind and rejuvenating your spirit.\n\nGuided by Vivek from
  Asheville\, this immersive sound meditation features over 40 handcrafted 
 singing bowls\, each producing a rich spectrum of intricate\, highly somat
 ic frequencies and overtones. More than just a sound bath\, these harmonio
 us and grounding tones can profoundly influence your physical\, emotional\
 , mental\, and spiritual states\, helping you reset and start your week wi
 th clarity and balance.\n\nThis event is open to all levels—whether you
 ’re a seasoned mindfulness enthusiast\, exploring a novel path to relaxa
 tion\, or simply seeking stress relief.\n\n\\*\\* $26 to Reserve a spot pl
 ease use Event Link or Contact Vivek\n**[Every Weekend @ 11am\, 3pm & 6pm]
 (https://somaticsounds.net/events/)**\nOr\n**[Contact Vivek](https://somat
 icsounds.net/contact/)**\n\n#soundhealing #soundbath #meditation
